<title>USA: Lucent Technologies Inc Q1 oper net rises.</title>
<headline>Lucent Technologies Inc Q1 oper net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MURRAY HILL, N.J. 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr		    $1.35		    $1.30</p>
<p> Oper net		  859,000		  830,000</p>
<p> Revs		    7,938,000		7,427,000</p>
<p>			  12 Mths</p>
<p> Oper shr			 NA			 NA</p>
<p> Oper net		1,083,000		  980,000</p>
<p> Revs		   23,797,000	     21,413,000</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures are for fiscal Q1 periods ended Dec 31 and calendar years ended Dec 31.</p>
<p>Q1 1995 figures are pro forma and use the 636.7 million shrs outstanding subsequent to IPO of 112.0 million shrs in April 1996, and give no effect to the use of proceeds from the IPO.</p>
<p>Q1 1995 oper net excludes restructuring, impairment and other charges of $2.80 bln. Net including these charges is loss $1.60/shr.</p>
</text>
